{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gg9DYstpAt1795167013.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》日前圓滿落幕，一眾花旦當晚均盛裝爭妍鬥麗。向來氣質清新的陳曉華亦悉心打扮赴會，事後於社交平台分享多張台慶造型寫真，並以英文配文分享當晚的夢幻感受：「Pure ethereal romance from last night. With fluttering 🩷🩵feathers, it felt like floating in a weightless dream. 🪽✨」以及「Dressed in joy, wandering happily wherever life takes me」。</p><p><p><img alt=\"herachann_1795161280_4034420226430149293_13477856.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ij4wDO9cIy1795166531.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>曝光的造型照中，陳曉華以一身純白仙氣戰衣亮相，上身是簡約優雅的白色方領無袖剪裁，下身則拼接如雲朵與羽毛般輕盈的多層次荷葉邊薄紗長裙，裙襬高衩設計在走動與坐下時微露白滑美腿。為增添整體造型的華麗感，她將一頭長捲髮自然披散，頭上佩戴設計繁複的銀色水鑽與珍珠流蘇頭飾，配襯酒紅色指甲及閃耀戒指手鏈，散發濃厚的浪漫與空靈氣息。 </p><p><p><img alt=\"herachann_1795161280_4034420252351061815_13477856.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oGVGCSDOD11795166539.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>取景方面亦相當別出心裁，除了在舞台璀璨燈飾及後台鐵架前擺出高貴甫士外，陳曉華更走到電視城戶外空地，毫無架子地直接坐在柏油路上，任由層層白紗在身旁鋪開，在夜色映襯下格外唯美；其中一張她穿著華麗晚裝漫步經過連鎖便利店門外的遠鏡照片，更營造出日常與夢幻交錯的獨特氛圍。</p><p><p><img alt=\"herachann_1795161280_4034420229978530762_13477856.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sXPIoSrvsi1795166572.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T06:03:43.380652+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":555,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T05:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T18:37:32.100999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T05:57:12.761097+00:00","content_hash":"b4ff9ac9f53fa1e36ec6d8189fedf0f74225666c99ed4e85af7de1c9ac258098","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T06:03:43.380652+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}